<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brooktrout upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brooktrout upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential &amp; Co analyst Lissa Bogaty said she upgraded Brooktrout Technology Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- cited the stock price, and said she has a 12-month price target of $41.</p>
<p>-- said fundamentals &quot;are intact, excellent.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3-31/64 to 29-49/64 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
